src/strategies.py contains a re-implementation of the large-table context
selection in CausalPFN (https://github.com/vdblm/CausalPFN, commit b7ed2f1,
`CausalEstimator._predict_cepo`), with bookkeeping and alternative strategies
added. CausalPFN itself is not included in this repository.
